    {"id": "Q07", "question": "A national court asks whether the EU rules on the sustainability and GHG-saving criteria for biofuels (Arts 17–18 of Directive 2009/28 and Arts 29–30 of Directive 2018/2001) govern how to measure the renewable share of fuel produced by 'co-processing', and separately whether a Member State may require a specific HVO-content measurement method at the pump. What did the Court rule in BP France (C-624/22)?"},
